<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells manganese ore.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells manganese ore.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 3,100 short dry tons of metallurgical grade manganese ore valued at approximately $141,000, and 45 sdt of chemical grade manganese ore valued at about $3,000 to American Minerals and Prince Manufacturing respectively.</p>
<p>The next date of receiving manganese ore bids is June 3.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
